{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"安心してください。ブログ始まりますよ\nとにかく明るいヒナコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！8回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".jackさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな？皆さん安心してくれたかな？(｡・・｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の冒頭あいさつも募集してまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"威嚇顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今お風呂に入りながら、ブログを書いているので\n上手く携帯が使えてません！！！\n誤字とかあったらごめんなさい。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近おしゃれな入浴剤とか\nすごそうな入浴剤とか\nいろいろな入浴剤がおいてあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貰ったりもするから\nずっと使わずに貯めてあったんだけど\n遂に！！！1つ使ってみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その入浴剤が入ったお風呂が\nいま入ってるお風呂なんですけど\n炭酸がジュワーってなってるみたいで\nパチパチしてるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感動してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで、炭酸とか\nパチパチしたり泡だったり\n特殊な効果のある入浴剤を\n使ったことがなかったから\n新世界に突入した気持ちです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入浴剤はまりそう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもたくさん入浴剤あるから\nいろいろ挑戦していこうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かオススメの入浴剤があったら\n教えてください！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんからお誕生日にもらった\n素敵な入浴剤は素敵すぎるから\nそのまま飾ってあります♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飾っても素敵なの！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年のひめちゃんのお誕生日プレゼントなににしようかなー(｡・・｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめちゃんがその頃になにが欲しいのか\n探らないと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんバレないようにね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールの二期生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館アンダーライブ\nがんばろうねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/12/3233778/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t